@startuml
skinparam activityArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10

|User|
start
:Reaches checkout summary page;

|Frontend|
:GET /models/:id/license OR /cart/licenses;

|Database|
:Fetch License records for all models in order;

|Backend|
:Return license details for each model;

|Frontend|
:Display license terms per model (FREE, PERSONAL, COMMERCIAL, EXCLUSIVE);
:Show usage restrictions and attributions required;

|User|
:Reviews all license terms;
if (agrees to all terms?) then (yes)
  :Checks "I agree" checkbox;
  |Frontend|
  :Enable "Continue to Payment" button;
else (no)
  :Leaves checkout;
  stop
endif

|Frontend|
:Proceed to payment flow;
stop
@enduml
